        var pattern = /STEMI|NSTEMI|ST elevation|ST depression|VT\b|VF\b|ventricular (tachy|fibri)|complete heart block|3rd[- ]degree AV|prolonged QTc|torsades|Mobitz II|new LBBB|new RBBB|junctional/i;
